Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.30,0:00:09.35,Cap,,0,0,0,,Wait — I can learn\Nwithout reading anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.60,0:00:13.36,Cap,,0,0,0,,Bro, {\c&HFF5CB4&}GEORGE WASHINGTON{\c&HFFFFFF&}\Nliterally invented America.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.90,0:00:15.90,Cap,,0,0,0,,No way — did he get funding?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.15,0:00:18.15,Cap,,0,0,0,,Yeah, dude. {\c&HFF5CB4&}SERIES A.{\c&HFFFFFF&} From {\c&HFF5CB4&}FRANCE.{\c&HFFFFFF&}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.20,0:00:19.60,Cap,,0,0,0,,BROOOOO!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.05,0:00:21.65,Cap,,0,0,0,,Who funded the American Revolution?
